# Educational notes:
# - `dist/` is the output of `npm run build` (static assets). It should be built in CI/CD.
# - `*.local` is a common convention for machine-specific settings; avoid committing it.
# - Keeping `.vscode/extensions.json` is a handy way to recommend editor plugins without committing personal settings.
dist/
